er at $(6,3)$, where the top and right boundaries are included, and the left boundary is excluded.\n\n![](images/80/80d02d152f41e88c9533d06887a925a6acd9438924b36a3c1268e04d150ea1ac.png)\n\nGeometrically, this region can be obtained by taking all points in the infinite rectangle that has its top-right corner at $(8,3)$ (the blue region below) and *subtracting* all points in the infinite rectangle that has its top-right corner at $(6,3)$ (the red region below).\n\n![](images/d0/d094730505c58c936e5d4313ca9a9fc9c6ff9fd117f591a9382ef0719f8b8df3.png)\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nP(X > 6, Y \\le 3) &= P(X \\le 8, Y \\le 3)^(⏞)^(top-right corner at [math](8,3)[/math]) - P(X \\le 6, Y \\le 3)^(⏞)^(top-right corner at [math](6,3)[/math]) \\\\\n&= F(8, 3) - F(6, 3) \\\\\n&= 0.9 - 0.7 \\\\\n&= 0.2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535218 17592186045417 false] [17592186162124 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481359 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162124 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481400 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162124 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481412 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162124 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481415 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162125 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481349 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162125 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481372 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162125 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481406 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162125 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481437 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162130 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481369 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162130 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481374 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162130 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481377 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162130 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481398 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162130 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481416 13194139535218 17592186045417 true] [17592186162131 1038 #edb/ref 17592186481341 13194139535218 17592186045417